This project is an independent reimplementation. The semantic-projection
approach was originally explored in the ISC-licensed `SemanticFinder`
project; no source file from it is carried over verbatim, but the debt is
recorded here to satisfy that licence's retention clause, which applies to
any derived work regardless of how thoroughly it is rewritten.

